  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.170" end="00:04.610" ttm:agent="v1">Ooh, baby, can't you see I love you and my world around you?</p>
      <p begin="00:04.610" end="00:07.630" ttm:agent="v1">Just let me adore you, don't let me down</p>
      <p begin="00:07.630" end="00:12.410" ttm:agent="v1">Ooh, baby, can't you see I love you and my world around you?</p>
      <p begin="00:12.410" end="00:15.410" ttm:agent="v1">Just let me adore you, don't let me down</p>
      <p begin="00:15.410" end="00:20.380" ttm:agent="v1">Ooh, baby, can't you see I love you and my world around you?</p>
      <p begin="00:20.380" end="00:23.200" ttm:agent="v1">Just let me adore you, don't let me down</p>
      <p begin="00:23.200" end="00:27.150" ttm:agent="v1">All night, all day, can't let you get away</p>
      <p begin="00:27.150" end="00:31.450" ttm:agent="v1">No talk, moonwalk until we levitate</p>
      <p begin="00:31.450" end="00:35.060" ttm:agent="v1">Watchin' crowds all conversate</p>
      <p begin="00:35.060" end="00:38.150" ttm:agent="v1">I'm fallin' off, I'm on my way</p>
      <p begin="00:38.150" end="00:42.680" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause if is me and you, I could be the one who saved</p>
      <p begin="00:42.680" end="00:46.920" ttm:agent="v1">You from all the troubles that you never really say, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:46.920" end="00:50.820" ttm:agent="v1">Just take my hand, don't hesitate</p>
      <p begin="00:50.820" end="00:54.630" ttm:agent="v1">It's in the plan, I'm on my way, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:54.630" end="00:59.380" ttm:agent="v1">Ooh, baby, can't you see I love you and my world around you?</p>
      <p begin="00:59.380" end="01:02.330" ttm:agent="v1">Just let me adore you, don't let me down</p>
      <p begin="01:02.330" end="01:07.100" ttm:agent="v1">Ooh, baby, can't you see I love you and my world around you?</p>
      <p begin="01:07.100" end="01:10.120" ttm:agent="v1">Just let me adore you, don't let me down</p>
      <p begin="01:10.120" end="01:13.830" ttm:agent="v1">Ooh, baby, can't you see I love you? Put you on like</p>
      <p begin="01:13.830" end="01:17.490" ttm:agent="v1">Turn it up, louder than speaker, uh, keep it hot like a fever</p>
      <p begin="01:17.490" end="01:21.970" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I'm down, down, down for whatever, girl, when you around, life is better</p>
      <p begin="01:21.970" end="01:25.250" ttm:agent="v1">We could sound like divas, and we could just kick it like FIFA</p>
      <p begin="01:25.250" end="01:29.290" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause it's me and you forever, if you ever walk away</p>
      <p begin="01:29.290" end="01:33.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I don't know to do without you, it's all pain (ah-ah)</p>
      <p begin="01:33.730" end="01:37.670" ttm:agent="v1">So take my hand, don't hesitate</p>
      <p begin="01:37.670" end="01:41.360" ttm:agent="v1">You know the plans, I'm on my way</p>
      <p begin="01:41.360" end="01:46.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Ooh, baby, can't you see I love you and my world around you? (Ah-ah)</p>
      <p begin="01:46.250" end="01:48.930" ttm:agent="v1">Just let me adore you, don't let me down</p>
      <p begin="01:48.930" end="01:53.950" ttm:agent="v1">Ooh, baby, can't you see I love you and my world around you?</p>
      <p begin="01:53.950" end="01:59.440" ttm:agent="v1">Just let me adore you, don't let me down</p>
      <p begin="01:59.440" end="02:03.500" ttm:agent="v1">Don't let me down</p>
      <p begin="02:03.500" end="02:07.460" ttm:agent="v1">Don't let me down</p>
      <p begin="02:07.460" end="02:10.300" ttm:agent="v1">Don't let me down</p>
      <p begin="02:10.300" end="02:13.270" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="02:13.270" end="02:14.770" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Don't let me down)</p>
      <p begin="02:14.510" end="02:19.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Ooh, baby, can't you see I love you and my world around you? (Ah-ah)</p>
      <p begin="02:19.480" end="02:22.350" ttm:agent="v1">Just let me adore you, don't let me down</p>
      <p begin="02:22.350" end="02:27.110" ttm:agent="v1">Ooh, baby, can't you see I love you and my world around you?</p>
      <p begin="02:27.110" end="02:32.630" ttm:agent="v1">Just let me adore you, don't let me down</p>
      <p begin="02:32.630" end="02:36.510" ttm:agent="v1">Don't let me down</p>
      <p begin="02:36.510" end="02:40.480" ttm:agent="v1">Don't let me down</p>
      <p begin="02:40.480" end="02:44.490" ttm:agent="v1">Don't let me down, mm</p>
